  Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The Agents tab stops flickering under an active filter query and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]live agent churn: unchanged-data refreshes patch instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]full-rebuilding, no-op fleet reprojections stop repainting, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]consecutive load tiers converge on one stable visible agent set, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and tribe panels such as @epic stay mounted.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]agents_tab_flicker.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/agents_tab_flicker.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-127[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-127/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop the visible-set oscillation across load tiers[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]converge-load-tiers[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]converge-load-tiers: reproduce the bounded-vs-revalidate agent-set swing[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with a failing test, fix the incomplete-load merge and complete-history [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]latch so consecutive loads converge, and assert panel-key stability [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]across a bounded apply.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Incremental panel refresh with an active filter query[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]incremental-under-search[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]incremental-under-search: allow the incremental display diff path when [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the search query text is unchanged, keep a distinct full-rebuild [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fallback for query changes, and cover both with tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Skip no-op fleet reprojection repaints[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]skip-noop-fleet-repaint[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]skip-noop-fleet-repaint: signature-compare fleet projection inputs and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]skip finalize/repaint when unchanged, preserving forced sources and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]genuine changes, with tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Regression coverage and on-host verification[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]verify-on-athena[dim] · [dim][/dim]after converge-load-tiers, incremental-under-search, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]skip-noop-fleet-repaint[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify-on-athena: soak the fixed TUI on athena with trace capture, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compare against the recorded pre-fix baselines, add a guard test against[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]silent full-rebuild regressions, and record CPU before/after.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-127","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-127.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-127.1"},"source_run_id":"run-2f491872166ba5c4fb4c6c686124dabf","started_at":"2026-09-17T20:59:14.711103+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"e5d6ef59d81d96469d1789f800283cddcb7f6db5395b759526af46e8ad844750","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-127.1-